      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: a27c50b6b538a42eaa4899948f125870, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: "I found some torn newspapers and posters, what looks to be a machine
        to make these\u2026?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: a27c50b6b538a42eaa4899948f125870, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: The Disidensiya has an outpost to the west that they use to print publicity
        materials. If my hunch is right, that might just be where you are now, too.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
